#------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Name            : FI_TDclosure.scr
#  Description     : close TD accounts
#  Date            : 25-02-2022
#  Author          : James Maina
#  Input           : NA
#  Output          : NA
#  Called Script   : NA
#  Menu Option     :  (API)
#  Srl. No         Date            Author               Description.
